<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
    Timeline panel - bottom dock, "Editor" (objName "timelinePanel", root
    "TimelinePanelWidget").

    Static-layout capture of src/ui/TimelineWidget.cpp (constructor).
    Object names are the reference ones. The layer tree (TimelineTree), the
    track canvas (TimelineCanvas) and the value graph (TimelineValueGraphView)
    are custom-painted widgets promoted when wired; the tree rows and the
    keyframe-type buttons are rebuilt at runtime.

    The form is loaded by TimelineWidget through AUTOUIC. Runtime menus,
    icons, the Start page and model bindings remain in C++.
-->
